          "kicker": "Coaching staff",
          "heading": "Jake White eyes trusted Springbok ally for Fiji coaching team",
          "body": "Jake White's assistant coaches remain unannounced. Reports have the former Springboks boss eyeing a trusted Springbok ally for his Fiji coaching team, after Fiji appointed him head coach in mid-October ahead of the 2027 World Cup. No announcement of those assistant coaches appears in today's coverage, and the ally is still not named in the reports."
