      }
    },
    "389": {
      "date": "2026-11-05",
      "edition": "Thursday 5 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Scrum battle",
          "heading": "Muhamed Hasa braces Italy for scrum battle with Springboks' front row",
          "body": "Italy prop Muhamed Hasa says the scrum will be one of the key aspects of Saturday's Nations Championship Test in Turin, and he will face a Springboks front row featuring Ox Nché, Malcolm Marx and Thomas du Toit. \"South Africa are arguably the best team in the world in that area,\" the Zebre prop said at a media briefing. Italy are without captain Michele Lamaro, centres Ignacio Brex and Tommaso Menoncello and winger Louis Lynagh, and Hasa admitted the absences create an opportunity for others to step up."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Ireland's Porter, Baird and Hansen return for Argentina clash",
