      "edition": "Thursday 5 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Selection call",
          "heading": "Kurtley Beale, 37, recalled to Wallabies squad for northern hemisphere Nations tour",
          "body": "Les Kiss has named Beale for the northern leg, which takes in England, Scotland and Wales, replacing Hunter Paisami, unavailable for personal reasons. Beale, who turns 38 in January, last played a Test in 2021, against Wales in Cardiff, and an Achilles injury cut short his last squad stint in 2024. He says his role now is to \"create some competition within the team\", and he has been with the Western Force since 2024."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Ireland's Porter, Baird and Hansen return for Argentina clash",
